{
  "bookId": "hero-212111",
  "id": "bond-43808",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "43808001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "……房间里那个酷似方盒子的法宝，似乎有许多妙用。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43808003",
              "text": "它叫电脑。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43808003",
              "text": "它是让人堕落的元凶之一哦。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43808002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "可以教我使用它吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "华焱说，有什么不懂的都可以在上面查。我想看看这个世界的人类都在做些什么。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43808006",
              "text": "没问题，我教你。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43808005",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "花了一番工夫，教会了龙缨如何开机，操作键鼠，在浏览器里搜索关键字。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "一段时间后……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "安静的卧室里，只能听见鼠标的点击声和零星的键盘敲击声。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "……这样吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43808012",
              "text": "怎么了？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43808011",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "只是有些感慨，未想此世的人们已经征服了海洋和天空，甚至将要向地外空间进发。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "早已不需要人外之物的庇佑了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43808015",
              "text": "你好像有点感伤。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43808014",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "我曾谛听人间的祈福之声，替人消灾除祟，但渐渐地，声音愈发稀少。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "我原以为下界出了什么祸患，以致人们无暇祈愿。每每提及，烛大人只是报以微笑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "后来我得知了缘由，人们只是不再需要庇护了——他们走出了自己的路。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43808019",
              "text": "人类是会成长的。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43808019",
              "text": "传说会留下你的功绩。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43808018",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "是啊，在那个世界是如此，在这个世界亦是如此。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "至少，还有一个人类需要你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "……是谁？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43808023",
              "text": "你能听到那个人的祈愿。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43808022",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "呵……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "少女总是平静无波的脸庞，带上了恬淡的笑意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "是我生疏了，竟然连身边人的心声都未能顾及。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43808026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "我答应你，|101|。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
